{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10005_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:55815a54d0dd77bde91ed7b5e2565c8a97780c05d2ff4d962121966b7cfa8536",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b470e2c6e71e117ef845abae7b15e8b804cd27411d94a85063d120be7ae531c",
      "text": "活动结束数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303befb9a232b458c20ae821a2677ed9e77bc38928bdaa1d3ffbdb2101f81205",
      "text": "猫柳宅邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41f33ad2c73a20ea8e40382231ea9324b044584b2b95649368a40b044cf4c68f",
      "text": "哎呀呀……因此故而。\n唔唔唔，果然这里还是……唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392164ce68ef9ebf53f12537ece3007615340f42cc763f2e2bfa1ebdd5b96b5e",
      "text": "不行喵～！\n完全没有头绪喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38afd5e2324a7bb902bfab6248f16f255155b6edc6eb2e6fa49b9427c5620702",
      "text": "平时的话应该能啾哔哔——！地灵光一现才对，\n真是奇了怪了喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933e8953d2a317467a3a17556919c272120c4ad27ba9b0252a2834281abe1448",
      "text": "喂，在走廊都能听到你的声音了。\n到底怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fdae4ca0909c6f6e337d355a86afbd51b562c962015972c5b409e8712b4e26e",
      "text": "吾辈本想把前几天的实际工作当作素材，\n构思一段新落语段子喵，可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d220dc0e1db234f2a573484985836e185fab336b38e56c6ef9b0bd1c0823c11",
      "text": "不论怎么摆弄，都写不出比实际发生的事\n更有趣的段子喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abc736768c04379daf71fb729b548695b0a86626a91678efc468c2caf988fbda",
      "text": "吾辈的雷达，\n到底变成什么样了喵～！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9d779278370b7248706e239513e4a666e37a1b45027eb31919a498ad804b06f",
      "text": "呜呜……太惨了喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63517650fc9d6460dcbc18c999de052c99dfafdfebf57b39b9f7bd2d9402e968",
      "text": "那种二流三流的段子，可别讲给别人听啊。\n不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ab1b4b65d368deac1437b0f47769b5cfed81be42709c776aaf3f4a632c2711f",
      "text": "要是这样的话啊，桐生。\n那个段子，只在你们伙伴之间讲不就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42bb4add34844a6516e3af3785d3df9ab491b5eab65fe58ce959ee8cff664a50",
      "text": "只在伙伴之间限定的段子……\n不愧是师父，听起来好特别喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac15d39b1dc59f263513bee0d68cefabc8bbe567829df8a3488489ffc72aecd8",
      "text": "这是只属于我们大家的、\n特别故事喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
